WEBVTT
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]


00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.735
I'll go my way.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:30.822
Please come and meet me, my dear husband.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.036
My lady?

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:37.829
Your grace?

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:39.956
Oh, no. What's she doing?

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.293
My lady, what are you doing?
It's not safe!

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.587
-You could be badly injured!
-Madam!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.756
-Oh, dear.
-Your grace! My lady!

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:50.592
-Oh, my dear. My lady, please.
-Hurry, quickly!

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.719
Oh, dear.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.681
Eun-sil.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.142
Onwards.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:01.770
Your grace.

00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:11.362
Wait here.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.425
I…

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:42.560
I wa…

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:04.207
"An Hui-yeon."

00:02:37.574 --> 00:02:39.576
Because it's always been my wish…

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.499
to hold a child in my arms
that has your eyes.

00:02:48.209 --> 00:02:49.711
Do you see, dear cousin…

00:02:52.881 --> 00:02:55.675
those tokens of memories
expose your utmost desires.

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:02.599
Could…

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:06.644
Could you mean it?

00:03:10.648 --> 00:03:11.649
My lady!

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:16.070
Madam, it is I, Gye-hwa.
With your leave, may I enter?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.546
Madam,

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:37.050
the Lady of the First Rank has sent
another gift of medicinal herbs again.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:40.178
What would you like to do?
Shall we return it?

00:03:40.261 --> 00:03:42.388
The Left State Councilor's family matters.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.893
I trust you're aware of the sudden passing
of their son several years ago?

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:49.062
Along the journey to Hanyang,

00:03:49.145 --> 00:03:52.023
I encountered the young widow,
I'm nearly certain.

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:54.525
Though I only caught a glimpse of her.

00:03:57.904 --> 00:04:01.199
But she had an allure even
the most decorous gentleman would see.

00:04:02.659 --> 00:04:07.080
As if she deliberately hides
her sensuality to create this magnetism.

00:04:07.163 --> 00:04:08.581
And you believe this?

00:04:09.874 --> 00:04:12.168
You scoffed once at the mention of So-ok.

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:15.630
Clearly, the widow evokes in you
a more eager response.

00:04:20.176 --> 00:04:22.053
Can you see the obvious here?

00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:25.348
Comparing a young girl to a woman of fate.

00:04:25.848 --> 00:04:29.060
The woman of fate in full bloom
is far more interesting.

00:04:30.853 --> 00:04:32.605
Speaking so boldly, cousin.

00:04:32.689 --> 00:04:36.067
As if you've already charmed
the young widow into your comforting hold.

00:04:48.538 --> 00:04:49.539
Mmm.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.750
Anyone like that young widow…

00:04:56.796 --> 00:05:00.842
I could freely and easily
have her within a month.

00:05:01.551 --> 00:05:04.679
That woman has kept her virtue
untarnished by men for decades.

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:08.016
You believe you can coax her
into your affections?

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:11.644
A woman whose modesty
will not be compromised easily?

00:05:12.937 --> 00:05:14.063
Be honest.

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:16.149
What do you wish me to achieve?

00:05:16.232 --> 00:05:17.650
What do you mean?

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:19.944
I only intend to caution you,

00:05:20.028 --> 00:05:23.406
as harm is inevitable
if you manage the widow properly now.

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:26.159
Plus,
the Left State Councilor's family ties.

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:33.207
Regarding the proposal concerning So-ok,

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.544
I'll retract my words,
so put aside your reckless games.

00:05:36.627 --> 00:05:38.546
Reckless games?

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:41.299
Have faith, my dear cousin.

00:05:42.508 --> 00:05:44.469
Your jealousy is too apparent.

00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:47.013
It is for your consideration,
I say these things.

00:05:47.638 --> 00:05:49.307
Yet you only assume jealousy?

00:05:49.891 --> 00:05:51.100
Yes.

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:53.770
I merely meant to have some fun,
which you have ended.

00:05:54.437 --> 00:05:55.605
And now you…

00:05:57.065 --> 00:05:58.941
stir my curiosity even more.

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:01.277
Cousin.

00:06:03.988 --> 00:06:05.406
So you attempt to break it

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.326
though the cost of these actions
will bring you harm?

00:06:08.409 --> 00:06:09.452
Why?

00:06:09.952 --> 00:06:11.245
Am I not trustworthy?

00:06:11.913 --> 00:06:13.539
And if the mission is successful?

00:06:13.623 --> 00:06:14.874
I made my concerns known,

00:06:14.957 --> 00:06:18.336
but if you insist that you will
go forward with the plan then…

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:23.758
In that case, you shall be rewarded

00:06:24.258 --> 00:06:27.428
with whatever it is that you desire.

00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:31.265
Whatever

00:06:32.767 --> 00:06:34.268
I desire?

00:06:46.864 --> 00:06:49.534
Dear cousin, you alone drive my desire.

00:06:50.201 --> 00:06:51.369
Surely you must know

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:54.497
I have waited for you for over ten years.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.918
Then, my dear cousin.

00:06:59.001 --> 00:07:02.964
Can you provide the sounds
of that young widow opening herself to you

00:07:03.714 --> 00:07:06.050
after decades with untarnished virtue

00:07:07.718 --> 00:07:11.389
in a mature piece of heartfelt writing?

00:07:21.732 --> 00:07:22.733
Yes.

00:07:27.822 --> 00:07:29.407
If it would please you,

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.910
I could offer to read them aloud to her.

00:07:35.204 --> 00:07:36.873
How will you make it up to me

00:07:37.915 --> 00:07:40.334
if the objective is left incomplete?

00:07:43.337 --> 00:07:44.964
You'll have many wishes.

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.926
First, I shall plant
a maternal seed in So-ok.

00:07:50.011 --> 00:07:52.305
Are you going to commit to your word?

00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:54.140
For you, I…

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:57.560
give you my word.

00:08:05.693 --> 00:08:08.404
-We're nearly prepared, correct?
-Most were handled this morning.

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:10.698
I'm looking forward to the meal.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.498
-All right! I understand!
-Hmm.

00:08:18.581 --> 00:08:21.083
This is nonsense.
To offer her boiled meat.

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:24.462
So now I'm meant to suffer
because my womb is devoid of child?

00:08:24.545 --> 00:08:26.839
I would die to eat some meat too.

00:08:26.923 --> 00:08:28.257
Eun-sil.

00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:31.969
Eun-sil! I said,
we're going to leave soon!

00:08:32.053 --> 00:08:34.263
I already said I heard you!

00:08:39.977 --> 00:08:44.607
Uh, nice to… to meet. A pleasure.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.984
-Is your name Eun-sil?
-Yes.

00:08:47.068 --> 00:08:50.238
A beautiful name
suited for your nice looks.

00:08:50.321 --> 00:08:51.656
Oh, wow.

00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:55.117
What you conceal down there is also nice.

00:08:56.536 --> 00:08:58.454
Very nice.

00:08:59.914 --> 00:09:00.998
Hmm?

00:09:01.082 --> 00:09:02.416
Hmm?

00:09:03.167 --> 00:09:05.461
Get your hands off me, you wretched man.

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:06.712
No, just…

00:09:06.796 --> 00:09:07.880
Wait! Hey!

00:09:07.964 --> 00:09:10.508
I wanted to ask
if you're craving any meat today?

00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:17.598
My lord!

00:09:18.933 --> 00:09:20.226
My lord.

00:09:22.019 --> 00:09:25.648
I think she has a craving for fresh meat.

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:27.483
-Fresh meat?
-Yes.

00:09:29.026 --> 00:09:32.530
Well, now to be eating meat
while still in mourning…

00:09:32.613 --> 00:09:34.115
It's Eun-sil, though.

00:09:34.615 --> 00:09:35.658
The lady's servant girl.

00:09:37.994 --> 00:09:39.370
-Eun-sil?
-Yes.

00:09:39.453 --> 00:09:41.706
-You've already introduced yourselves now?
-Yes.

00:09:42.707 --> 00:09:43.708
You see,

00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:46.127
it is only thanks to my fine master,

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.879
who so kindly has given me pork
and beef and many meats.

00:09:48.963 --> 00:09:53.551
Yet others at my station have never
had the honor to experience such things.

00:09:56.304 --> 00:09:57.305
Correct?

00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:02.393
I'd like to know where
that girl Eun-sil has gone.

00:10:02.476 --> 00:10:03.894
Mmm. Yes.

00:10:33.549 --> 00:10:34.550
Here.

00:10:45.978 --> 00:10:47.146
Perfect.

00:10:51.275 --> 00:10:52.401
My lady,

00:10:53.694 --> 00:10:55.446
you cannot escape my mind.

00:10:56.656 --> 00:10:57.698
Your thoughts, Chil-seong?

00:10:58.282 --> 00:10:59.283
Good. Yes.

00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:00.701
Nah, not that.

00:11:00.785 --> 00:11:01.952
I must do better.

00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:04.330
Tormented by your face each day

00:11:04.955 --> 00:11:06.248
of the first…

00:11:06.874 --> 00:11:08.292
first moment's sight.

00:11:08.376 --> 00:11:09.377
That feels right?

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.461
Yes.

00:11:18.761 --> 00:11:19.929
Dimwit.

00:11:20.805 --> 00:11:22.056
You mustn't move yet.

00:11:22.139 --> 00:11:23.933
This is all wrong.

00:11:25.518 --> 00:11:26.519
Again.

00:11:49.834 --> 00:11:50.918
My lady!

00:11:51.502 --> 00:11:54.046
Oh, my. Oh, my, look who it is!

00:11:54.672 --> 00:11:56.257
It has been a long while.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.051
-Your name, sir?
-Which family are you from, sir?

00:11:59.135 --> 00:12:00.386
I'm unfamiliar with your face.

00:12:00.469 --> 00:12:02.096
You say I'm not familiar to you?

00:12:02.179 --> 00:12:04.765
Pardon, the brother-in-law
to Minister Yoo, my lady.

00:12:05.266 --> 00:12:07.393
Cho Won is my name.

00:12:07.977 --> 00:12:10.646
I simply intended to greet you
as I assumed we had met.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.065
But please forgive me
if I have offended you.

00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:15.109
Our home is quite near
to Lord Yoo's estate,

00:12:15.192 --> 00:12:18.571
so you may have seen each other
in passing.

00:12:19.196 --> 00:12:22.616
Ah, then that means you are the Lady Cho's
striking younger brother?

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.452
We are cousins, madam.

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:37.423
If you please, I can arrange a call
with my dear cousin.

00:12:37.506 --> 00:12:38.674
Please do so.

00:12:41.677 --> 00:12:42.678
My lady.

00:12:44.388 --> 00:12:45.890
My lady, madam, wait, wait.

00:12:46.474 --> 00:12:47.475
Hey.

00:12:47.558 --> 00:12:49.143
-Here, take it.
-What's this?

00:12:49.226 --> 00:12:50.227
It's a letter.

00:12:50.311 --> 00:12:52.104
-You know how to write?
-Just hurry up and deliver it.

00:13:07.536 --> 00:13:08.704
Heave ho.

00:13:12.416 --> 00:13:13.417
Whoa, whoa.

00:13:15.169 --> 00:13:16.253
Oh, my lady.

00:13:16.837 --> 00:13:18.297
Your hard work is appreciated.

00:13:18.881 --> 00:13:19.882
Thank you.

00:13:20.925 --> 00:13:25.471
Oh, I happened to run into your cousin
through an unexpected meeting.

00:13:26.347 --> 00:13:27.348
Pardon?

00:13:27.431 --> 00:13:30.184
I have heard so much about him, of course.

00:13:30.267 --> 00:13:33.521
He was exceptionally refined,
even in our small exchange.

00:13:33.604 --> 00:13:36.482
With no thoughts of doubt,
I knew you shared the same blood.

00:13:36.565 --> 00:13:38.275
That is quite the commendation.

00:13:39.568 --> 00:13:40.569
Please.

00:14:20.025 --> 00:14:21.443
Young Master Geum-ho…

00:14:22.403 --> 00:14:25.030
I humbly apologize.

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:26.657
I had grown accustomed to…

00:14:30.578 --> 00:14:32.580
Please keep your husband's memory alive.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.669
In our study annex,
back when he was with us,

00:14:38.752 --> 00:14:41.130
he consumed every book he could manage.

00:14:41.755 --> 00:14:45.175
It seems that he transcribed this book
while studying on his own.

00:14:45.968 --> 00:14:47.595
Give it a proper look now.

00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:13.454
Do you feel his boldness?
His steadfast resolve?

00:15:13.537 --> 00:15:14.997
It's right on the page.

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:23.213
Do you think you could tell me

00:15:23.797 --> 00:15:26.467
more of the person it was
that I was meant to wed?

00:15:33.807 --> 00:15:38.437
The young master had many traits
that made him remarkable.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.734
The sound of his reading
coming over the wall never ceased.

00:15:43.817 --> 00:15:47.404
He was the object
of the family elders' high expectations.

00:15:48.364 --> 00:15:50.282
I also heard that he scored higher

00:15:50.366 --> 00:15:53.494
than the other scholarly men
who took the initial examination.

00:15:55.537 --> 00:15:56.747
However,

00:15:57.665 --> 00:16:01.961
the version of him inside the mind
is another man entirely.

00:16:02.544 --> 00:16:05.047
He was a gentle and tender man.

00:16:05.756 --> 00:16:09.259
He once held a loose petal gently
in between his fingers.

00:16:10.094 --> 00:16:12.221
He admired it so quietly.

00:16:14.264 --> 00:16:17.434
His eyes would sparkle with curiosity
at every turn

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:21.563
as he'd observe and admire the world
as it would propel from season to season,

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:22.898
absorbing it all.

00:16:24.274 --> 00:16:26.235
When I think of him again,

00:16:27.236 --> 00:16:28.904
I'll remember his eyes.

00:16:54.221 --> 00:16:55.848
-Wait.
-Come. Now. Hurry. Go.

00:16:55.931 --> 00:16:57.182
Bun-hui?

00:16:57.266 --> 00:16:58.308
Go.

00:16:59.268 --> 00:17:00.519
Bun-hui.

00:17:00.602 --> 00:17:02.229
-Oh!
-Bun-hui!

00:17:02.312 --> 00:17:03.313
Wait.

00:17:04.648 --> 00:17:07.818
I haven't seen you in a moment at least.

00:17:10.654 --> 00:17:12.573
You dare to address me informally?

00:17:12.656 --> 00:17:15.576
Hey, pleased I got a look at you.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.703
Huh.

00:17:18.787 --> 00:17:23.042
So, I trust things are going well, huh?
Bun-hui.

00:17:26.503 --> 00:17:27.546
But I…

00:17:28.881 --> 00:17:30.924
still have etched in my memory

00:17:31.759 --> 00:17:34.595
that subtle smell you drenched all over,

00:17:34.678 --> 00:17:36.638
after all this time.

00:17:38.015 --> 00:17:39.349
You need to move.

00:17:39.433 --> 00:17:41.185
Oh, come on, Bun-hui.

00:17:41.268 --> 00:17:42.644
Sir, you have arrived.

00:17:43.145 --> 00:17:44.688
Ah, your grace.

00:17:44.772 --> 00:17:47.524
I would like you to meet the mother
to my lord's future concubine.

00:17:48.233 --> 00:17:49.359
Your grace?

00:17:49.985 --> 00:17:52.029
Wait a minute. Just a moment.

00:17:53.197 --> 00:17:55.699
Mother of the concubine destined for my…

00:17:56.366 --> 00:17:57.367
brother-in-law?

00:17:57.993 --> 00:18:00.370
B… Brother-in-law?

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:05.501
Huh. Brother-in-law. My goodness.

00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:07.503
Wait, then So-ok's mother…

00:18:07.586 --> 00:18:09.463
Brother-in-law.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.132
Why must…

00:18:18.222 --> 00:18:19.807
That damn aristocrat.

00:18:21.141 --> 00:18:22.768
This is miserable.

00:18:35.114 --> 00:18:36.698
That young woman…

00:18:37.783 --> 00:18:39.409
Most wenches aren't like her.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:41.411
Chil-seong!

00:18:41.495 --> 00:18:42.996
-Chil-seong!
-Mmm.

00:18:43.914 --> 00:18:46.917
Fan the scent. Go on.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.001
Ah.

00:18:51.088 --> 00:18:54.550
This meat is so tender
it melts in the mouth!

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:58.011
-That it does, sir!
-Oh, man that's fresh!

00:18:58.095 --> 00:18:59.555
Fresh indeed, sir!

00:19:03.475 --> 00:19:05.102
Just wait a moment.

00:19:05.185 --> 00:19:07.062
Thoughts so full of tasting meat.

00:19:07.688 --> 00:19:08.897
You'll come soon.

00:19:31.461 --> 00:19:34.548
The sun will set soon,
and she cannot resist.

00:19:43.056 --> 00:19:44.057
Could…

00:19:48.353 --> 00:19:49.438
Eun-sil.

00:19:53.692 --> 00:19:55.027
Wait. One moment.

00:19:59.948 --> 00:20:02.117
Here, here. Careful, careful.

00:20:03.118 --> 00:20:04.912
Water, water, water, water, water.

00:20:10.334 --> 00:20:11.919
A drink to wash it all down?

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.715
I am only moving it.
You'll choke if you don't drink.

00:20:25.182 --> 00:20:28.602
Can I ask why you would share meat
so voluntarily?

00:20:28.685 --> 00:20:30.854
Well, despite my lowly servant role,

00:20:30.938 --> 00:20:33.690
I am aware that the costs paid
for favors is rarely low.

00:20:34.274 --> 00:20:37.110
The message went, but has she read it yet?

00:20:38.862 --> 00:20:39.947
What you wrote?

00:20:40.614 --> 00:20:42.991
Your letter is safely tucked away
inside this robe.

00:20:43.742 --> 00:20:46.370
You don't, uh… Why haven't you, uh…

00:20:46.453 --> 00:20:48.956
Hey, now.
Wasn't that for me to read though?

00:20:49.039 --> 00:20:51.375
No. Oh. Uh… Oh, no.

00:20:51.458 --> 00:20:53.126
Looks like the meat is burning.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:56.213
I shall leave now to go get the meat. Yes.

00:20:57.422 --> 00:21:00.259
Ah, yes, it is good. Yes, yes.

00:21:01.718 --> 00:21:05.138
Tell me, will mourning come to an end
within the year?

00:21:05.847 --> 00:21:07.391
About fifteen days away.

00:21:08.058 --> 00:21:11.436
Then once mourning stops,
everything will be over.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.772
Good heavens. This looks good. Yes.

00:21:13.855 --> 00:21:16.066
Isn't it a good thing
if everything is over?

00:21:16.566 --> 00:21:18.735
During the mourning period,
you miss fine dining.

00:21:18.819 --> 00:21:21.113
-What of the Memorial Gate?
-W-What is that?

00:21:21.196 --> 00:21:23.198
Virtuous women
chase their husbands after they go.

00:21:23.282 --> 00:21:24.908
Oh.

00:21:26.451 --> 00:21:28.203
So ignorant of which you speak.

00:21:32.165 --> 00:21:33.875
I truly did not know.

00:21:34.501 --> 00:21:35.502
Hmm.

00:21:50.851 --> 00:21:52.185
I am your guide now.

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:55.605
Watch and listen carefully
for instructions.

00:21:57.024 --> 00:21:58.191
Yes.

00:21:58.275 --> 00:22:00.068
Sister, there are two more baskets coming.

00:22:00.152 --> 00:22:02.446
All right,
hurry and hand them over. Quickly.

00:22:16.918 --> 00:22:18.420
A moment, cousin?

00:22:18.503 --> 00:22:22.716
In our household, one's manners
are required to meet a certain standard.

00:22:22.799 --> 00:22:25.344
Ah, his lord's future concubine.

00:22:25.427 --> 00:22:27.054
So-ok, she's called.

00:22:29.181 --> 00:22:31.892
It is a pleasure, my lord.

00:22:33.393 --> 00:22:34.561
Pleased to meet you.

00:22:42.152 --> 00:22:44.863
Did you go and pay a visit
to the young widow?

00:22:49.242 --> 00:22:51.453
Were your words of your cousin flattering?

00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:54.998
Back in my family's home library,

00:22:55.082 --> 00:22:59.211
the Young Master Geum-ho
would use our study annex for many hours.

00:22:59.294 --> 00:23:01.630
-Ah.
-He left his writings.

00:23:01.713 --> 00:23:05.509
It seemed correct to return it
with gentle conversation.

00:23:06.009 --> 00:23:08.136
Unbelievable.

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:11.014
Her husband's very own notebook?

00:23:11.098 --> 00:23:15.394
How she begged me to please tell her
everything she did not get to know.

00:23:16.436 --> 00:23:18.897
I told her everything I could recall.

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:23.985
How she looked at that notebook
as though his mind lived inside.

00:23:25.612 --> 00:23:26.863
And you missed it.

00:23:27.614 --> 00:23:30.700
I will remember the look in her eyes,
dear cousin.

00:23:31.284 --> 00:23:32.661
Now imagine the widow,

00:23:32.744 --> 00:23:36.665
the same look fills her lonely eyes,
and then she begs for me to love her.

00:23:38.083 --> 00:23:42.295
I believe tonight's sweet slumber
may leave me troubled.

00:23:44.923 --> 00:23:48.468
I shan't worry then,
if you are so confident.

00:23:48.969 --> 00:23:51.430
It could really be quite the task

00:23:51.513 --> 00:23:56.184
if you do replace all those thoughts
of her husband that keep her mind full.

00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:58.854
He is a ghost.
How could he fill her thoughts?

00:23:59.354 --> 00:24:04.151
And where does his soul measure by
a living mortal who stands firmly present?

00:24:04.985 --> 00:24:07.404
She longs for a man she has not seen.

00:24:07.487 --> 00:24:10.699
Once our fated paths do meet,
my widow will beg for my touch.

00:24:11.616 --> 00:24:12.784
And do you believe,

00:24:13.702 --> 00:24:15.537
putting her lack of bravery aside,

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:20.917
your widow would summon the courage
to withstand the eyes and ears of Bukchon?

00:24:23.753 --> 00:24:26.506
If one falls into love
and loves with all their might…

00:24:29.259 --> 00:24:32.012
one knows these obstacles
pose nothing to fear.

00:24:33.138 --> 00:24:34.806
I feel assured, dear cousin,

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:37.601
you have known that feeling before.

00:24:42.564 --> 00:24:43.565
I…

00:24:45.609 --> 00:24:47.235
know that I can fill this role.

00:24:47.319 --> 00:24:48.778
And for you, cousin,

00:24:49.988 --> 00:24:52.657
become for her whatever it is you specify.

00:24:55.660 --> 00:24:56.786
That said,

00:24:57.704 --> 00:25:01.666
the ghost,
would he be Geum-ho by name then?

00:25:03.251 --> 00:25:04.252
Madam.

00:25:09.299 --> 00:25:12.219
The Left State Councilor
sends a welcome visitor, my lady.

00:25:36.368 --> 00:25:38.537
Oh, madam. By chance, did you forget?

00:25:39.037 --> 00:25:41.790
I had gone to Andong
to study among Confucian scholars.

00:25:41.873 --> 00:25:43.458
I'm In-ho.

00:25:43.542 --> 00:25:45.710
Oh, my. Grown so very tall.

00:25:45.794 --> 00:25:48.421
That small boy is now a fine young man.

00:25:49.756 --> 00:25:51.007
I trust all is well here?

00:25:51.716 --> 00:25:52.717
Mmm.

00:25:57.389 --> 00:26:00.308
I am the youngest son
of the Left State Councilor,

00:26:00.976 --> 00:26:02.310
Kwon In-ho, your grace.

00:26:02.394 --> 00:26:05.188
I come here of Minister Yoo's family ties.

00:26:05.272 --> 00:26:06.606
Cho Won is my name.

00:26:06.690 --> 00:26:07.691
Oh.

00:26:08.441 --> 00:26:12.946
You're the Cho Won renowned for
his writing during the initial examination

00:26:13.905 --> 00:26:15.448
about the southern sacred herb, no?

00:26:16.032 --> 00:26:17.367
Are you the same Cho Won?

00:26:17.450 --> 00:26:19.828
I am honored and humbled
to hear I am renowned.

00:26:19.911 --> 00:26:24.291
I have to thank one good friend
of remarkable prowess for literature.

00:26:24.374 --> 00:26:26.293
It is an honor to meet you.

00:26:26.376 --> 00:26:27.586
My fellow scholars and I

00:26:27.669 --> 00:26:31.214
have pondered over ways we should
learn further of your work's complexities.

00:26:31.298 --> 00:26:34.175
Past examinations are available
to review in the study annex.

00:26:35.093 --> 00:26:37.053
Why don't you two scholars go

00:26:37.137 --> 00:26:40.682
and have a nice quiet read
and perhaps discussion follows?

00:26:42.100 --> 00:26:43.101
Yes.

00:26:44.019 --> 00:26:46.438
Why don't you come with me, dear?

00:26:46.521 --> 00:26:50.609
We could certainly use
a little ladies' time, wouldn't you agree?

00:26:51.234 --> 00:26:52.235
Let me.

00:27:01.661 --> 00:27:03.163
Shall we go, young master?

00:27:10.837 --> 00:27:13.298
My mother-in-law asked me to thank you

00:27:13.381 --> 00:27:16.384
for bringing me
the keepsake of my husband's.

00:27:17.010 --> 00:27:19.220
She almost journeyed here for herself,

00:27:20.263 --> 00:27:22.724
but I begged Mother
to come instead in her place.

00:27:23.224 --> 00:27:24.976
I wanted to see you again.

00:27:25.560 --> 00:27:29.314
Oh, I hope I've not overstepped,
calling on you unannounced.

00:27:29.397 --> 00:27:31.941
For your presence, I am so grateful.

00:27:33.318 --> 00:27:37.072
You see that I myself have been missing
those sparkling eyes of yours.

00:27:38.865 --> 00:27:41.159
That's very kind.

00:27:46.581 --> 00:27:47.791
It stayed in place.

00:27:47.874 --> 00:27:49.334
Every single title.

00:27:49.417 --> 00:27:51.044
Did you visit often?

00:27:52.629 --> 00:27:54.506
My brother would bring us over here.

00:27:55.715 --> 00:27:58.301
-"This house holds any book you'd like."
-Hmm.

00:27:59.260 --> 00:28:01.971
Oh, I know of you, thanks to my brother.

00:28:02.472 --> 00:28:04.599
Thanks to him, wise master.

00:28:04.683 --> 00:28:06.101
Ah.

00:28:07.394 --> 00:28:08.436
Tell me then…

00:28:08.520 --> 00:28:12.273
That present in your writings
are principles of both schooling

00:28:12.357 --> 00:28:15.485
and the scale of which
we experience life's joys and sorrows.

00:28:15.568 --> 00:28:18.738
Unfortunately, I was not prepared

00:28:19.239 --> 00:28:21.616
to comprehend his meaning
at that young age.

00:28:24.411 --> 00:28:26.996
This year,
the lovely peonies bloomed quite nicely.

00:28:28.540 --> 00:28:30.750
Yes, you have quite a lovely garden.

00:28:30.834 --> 00:28:32.794
This peony reminds me of

00:28:33.795 --> 00:28:35.463
my husband's concubine.

00:28:37.048 --> 00:28:39.551
Mal-ttong,
there's a pretty flower over here.

00:28:39.634 --> 00:28:41.511
She is ever so lovely.

00:28:41.594 --> 00:28:43.221
Be careful!

00:28:43.304 --> 00:28:45.014
And much like a peony,

00:28:45.515 --> 00:28:49.894
she dons a pink smile on her soft lips
and dances throughout the house,

00:28:49.978 --> 00:28:52.397
her floral perfume wafting behind her.

00:28:58.778 --> 00:29:01.239
What were you like at that age, my lady?

00:29:01.322 --> 00:29:03.992
I'm sure you were
as lovely as you are today.

00:29:11.207 --> 00:29:13.585
Younger me believed
that joy would only come to me

00:29:13.668 --> 00:29:15.920
when I find a husband to marry and serve.

00:29:19.466 --> 00:29:21.509
Once the marriage was decided,

00:29:22.385 --> 00:29:25.847
I was no longer a child
and that feeling awakened my heart.

00:29:28.308 --> 00:29:29.350
Mmm.

00:29:30.560 --> 00:29:32.103
You asked me earlier

00:29:32.771 --> 00:29:35.857
why I gave my answer
during the palace examination.

00:29:36.858 --> 00:29:40.612
Well, your brother
happened onto something.

00:29:42.864 --> 00:29:44.324
At the time, I…

00:29:46.576 --> 00:29:48.578
had countless matters
that were plaguing me

00:29:48.661 --> 00:29:50.830
far more than one my age could bear.

00:29:50.914 --> 00:29:53.291
There was once a man I loved
with all my heart.

00:29:55.043 --> 00:29:58.254
Had we been foolish enough to act,
we surely would've been killed.

00:29:58.338 --> 00:30:00.507
Drifting from joy mixed with anger.

00:30:01.758 --> 00:30:04.177
From sorrow to pleasure.

00:30:05.637 --> 00:30:08.264
And so the content
of that heightened emotional era

00:30:08.348 --> 00:30:09.682
was poured into my answer.

00:30:09.766 --> 00:30:11.851
And yet, when I find I am weary,

00:30:13.102 --> 00:30:15.271
I think of the connection we once shared.

00:30:15.855 --> 00:30:17.232
It feels as though

00:30:18.233 --> 00:30:20.276
he could come
to the central hall right now,

00:30:20.360 --> 00:30:23.613
and could throw the door open,
and say I miss you.

00:30:36.751 --> 00:30:38.586
I would like to use this petal

00:30:39.087 --> 00:30:43.216
to wrap in confidence my secret for you
as a reminder of our friendship.

00:30:44.384 --> 00:30:47.929
Please come to me
if you are ever in need of help, my lady.

00:30:48.596 --> 00:30:49.639
Trust me,

00:30:50.431 --> 00:30:53.768
my ear is open for you
to safely share also.

00:31:20.712 --> 00:31:24.674
You can trust I can harbor a secret
better than a million men ever could.

00:31:28.469 --> 00:31:29.637
Honestly…

00:31:34.809 --> 00:31:39.397
Oh my!

00:31:46.446 --> 00:31:48.781
I once thought that pheasant
was my favorite thing,

00:31:48.865 --> 00:31:51.326
but it seems my thoughts have changed.

00:31:53.953 --> 00:31:59.792
You see this pheasant dish
barely compares to tasty cow.

00:32:03.922 --> 00:32:06.591
I may never even know what it says.

00:32:10.803 --> 00:32:13.222
The letters are just so very pretty.

00:32:15.141 --> 00:32:18.519
Take a look here.

00:32:19.729 --> 00:32:20.730
What?

00:32:25.109 --> 00:32:27.070
I hope I have a son.

00:32:30.156 --> 00:32:33.993
So that I can teach every letter to him.

00:32:38.498 --> 00:32:39.749
An alarm clock.

00:32:39.832 --> 00:32:43.419
From when my father would gift souvenirs
of his travels to the Great State.

00:32:43.503 --> 00:32:46.047
Wait, but it isn't food or anything.

00:32:46.631 --> 00:32:48.132
Why do you want that?

00:32:48.216 --> 00:32:50.093
You are not above my status.

00:32:50.176 --> 00:32:51.177
Hear me?

00:32:51.260 --> 00:32:52.720
Miss, what's it used for?

00:32:55.473 --> 00:32:57.725
This one works as a time-teller.

00:32:58.518 --> 00:33:03.564
These small needles go around and around
all day to keep track of the time.

00:33:04.649 --> 00:33:06.401
-Whoa.
-If it weren't for me,

00:33:06.484 --> 00:33:10.488
not a person here would have known of this
rare and ornate clock my old father gave.

00:33:10.571 --> 00:33:13.574
Are you not grateful to have me show you?

00:33:14.367 --> 00:33:16.911
Hey, where are you… I was not finished.

00:33:20.456 --> 00:33:22.291
What might you be doing here, my lady?

00:33:23.459 --> 00:33:24.585
Well…

00:33:25.211 --> 00:33:29.674
How are you so thoughtless
with something this special?

00:33:31.134 --> 00:33:33.011
Pardon me, is that an alarm clock?

00:33:33.594 --> 00:33:35.013
I have only read of these.

00:33:35.513 --> 00:33:37.265
Oh, books cannot compare here.

00:33:37.348 --> 00:33:39.559
Lord Yoo wants for nothing, as expected.

00:33:42.603 --> 00:33:43.688
Oh.

00:33:46.315 --> 00:33:47.608
If you take this…

00:33:49.068 --> 00:33:50.153
…give a little spin…

00:34:02.165 --> 00:34:04.292
Oh. Hey!

00:34:10.923 --> 00:34:12.759
I feared the heavens were torn apart.

00:34:13.342 --> 00:34:14.802
Uh, how could it do that?

00:34:16.387 --> 00:34:17.513
Come follow me, sir.

00:34:29.484 --> 00:34:30.485
I'm sorry.

00:34:31.069 --> 00:34:32.153
No.

00:34:34.113 --> 00:34:35.239
Damn it.

00:34:37.283 --> 00:34:38.284
There.

00:35:08.481 --> 00:35:11.192
Your palanquin has gone down the road,
my dear cousin.

00:35:12.068 --> 00:35:13.069
Who was in it?

00:35:17.240 --> 00:35:18.282
Cousin…

00:35:18.908 --> 00:35:23.412
I have many thoughts
of the day at the ferry landing.

00:35:24.789 --> 00:35:27.416
Thoughts of you waiting for me
a very long time.

00:35:30.878 --> 00:35:33.214
How much pain you have to hold…

00:35:36.259 --> 00:35:38.094
about that day, dear cousin.

00:35:59.323 --> 00:36:01.159
And what did you do that day?

00:36:14.338 --> 00:36:16.799
Now, if you hurry up,
you can catch that palanquin.

00:36:18.009 --> 00:36:20.970
The only passenger is likely able
to give you the help you need.

00:36:24.390 --> 00:36:26.392
Could it be the young widow there?

00:36:31.564 --> 00:36:33.524
Why are you helping like this?

00:36:39.989 --> 00:36:42.241
Do you feel burdened by the past we share?

00:36:44.452 --> 00:36:47.914
We can say that today
I have feelings of extreme loneliness.

00:36:48.581 --> 00:36:52.585
You should hurry,
or she'll go so far you might lose her.

00:36:54.170 --> 00:36:56.339
The more I get to know you, cousin…

00:37:04.222 --> 00:37:06.557
…the less I understand about your mind.

00:37:24.450 --> 00:37:26.535
A marriage proposal has arrived.

00:37:27.662 --> 00:37:30.456
Scholar official Yoo Hong-sang
seeks your hand.

00:37:31.540 --> 00:37:33.167
The family shows no reproach,

00:37:33.793 --> 00:37:37.922
even towards a presumptuous woman
who reads proper script.

00:37:38.005 --> 00:37:40.216
It is a house where a man possesses

00:37:40.800 --> 00:37:43.469
both of the boldness
and the graceful regard

00:37:43.552 --> 00:37:45.846
to create a rhyme, recite poems,

00:37:45.930 --> 00:37:48.683
and share a lifetime
of harmony with his wife.

00:38:08.077 --> 00:38:09.412
MUN-HEUL

00:38:09.495 --> 00:38:11.038
Please take it.

00:38:11.122 --> 00:38:12.123
What would you do?

00:38:12.206 --> 00:38:13.374
I'm leaving at dawn.

00:38:13.457 --> 00:38:15.876
-How will I--
-Look, if you can deliver the letter,

00:38:15.960 --> 00:38:17.712
our journeys will not diverge.

00:38:43.696 --> 00:38:45.031
Won,

00:38:45.114 --> 00:38:49.035
it seems I am a woman
who desires to love after all.

00:38:50.202 --> 00:38:52.663
Even now,
as my future is fated to another.

00:38:53.164 --> 00:38:55.666
My eyes, my hands,

00:38:56.208 --> 00:38:59.170
and my heart are all searching for you.

00:39:01.005 --> 00:39:02.798
So I shall ask you one favor.

00:39:03.299 --> 00:39:05.968
At the place
where sorrowful tears once flowed,

00:39:06.052 --> 00:39:08.054
I will set a lonely ferry afloat.

00:39:08.637 --> 00:39:10.431
Could you please wait for me?

00:39:11.557 --> 00:39:14.310
I will return to you.

00:39:41.045 --> 00:39:42.213
Oh, father.

00:39:44.215 --> 00:39:45.633
Yun, is that you?

00:39:46.634 --> 00:39:48.094
What are you doing up right now?

00:39:49.678 --> 00:39:52.723
What brings my father to weep
on a night out by himself?

00:39:58.521 --> 00:40:00.064
It was such a waste.

00:40:01.065 --> 00:40:05.611
If you were born a man,
you'd achieve top honors on your…

00:40:07.530 --> 00:40:09.740
If only, instead, you were a man.

00:40:13.744 --> 00:40:17.164
You would have had
countless opportunities for recognition.

00:40:18.374 --> 00:40:22.044
But now that your marriage
has been arranged,

00:40:22.795 --> 00:40:24.505
how many times

00:40:25.840 --> 00:40:29.051
will I be able to see your face
before I die?

00:41:58.766 --> 00:42:02.394
Now we exchange mutual bows.

00:42:07.358 --> 00:42:10.694
The groom will bow from the side.

00:42:12.988 --> 00:42:14.448
My lady, live well.

00:42:20.746 --> 00:42:24.416
Let the ceremony proceed to the next rite.

00:42:24.500 --> 00:42:27.920
Bring forward the groom.

00:42:44.562 --> 00:42:48.065
Hey, madam! Just a little peek.

00:42:48.148 --> 00:42:50.734
Come closer, I won't tell.

00:42:50.818 --> 00:42:53.320
Dearest Kkot-bun, come here. Come, come.

00:42:53.404 --> 00:42:56.991
-Come hither, child. Come to me.
-I've gone and done it all.

00:42:57.658 --> 00:42:59.702
Here, here.

00:43:04.832 --> 00:43:08.168
Young master.
I'm grateful to welcome you here.

00:43:10.045 --> 00:43:11.505
I did not recognize you.

00:43:11.589 --> 00:43:13.966
-Madam!
-Please, this way to collect your clothes.

00:43:14.049 --> 00:43:15.092
Madam!

00:43:16.719 --> 00:43:17.720
Madam.

00:43:22.641 --> 00:43:24.143
Please mend my jeogori.

00:43:27.229 --> 00:43:28.355
Here we are.

00:43:30.566 --> 00:43:32.026
Mm-hmm.

00:43:40.784 --> 00:43:42.703
All right, this arm first.

00:43:44.330 --> 00:43:45.831
Oh, no.

00:43:48.709 --> 00:43:51.003
Do forgive me for this foolish error.

00:43:51.086 --> 00:43:53.422
I will mend it
so you have the perfect fit.

00:43:55.132 --> 00:43:57.593
I managed somehow
to mistake your measurements.

00:43:58.344 --> 00:44:00.179
No, I think that I grew.

00:44:00.763 --> 00:44:02.514
And these measurements were taken when…

00:44:03.682 --> 00:44:04.892
Would you tell me…

00:44:06.560 --> 00:44:11.649
just why I noticed you filled
with so much grief on the river's shore?

00:44:13.734 --> 00:44:15.569
That's a strange thing to think.

00:44:20.574 --> 00:44:22.409
The tears on your face
sparkled in the sun.

00:44:23.035 --> 00:44:24.536
They were still wet.

00:44:26.538 --> 00:44:27.998
The one I loved dearly,

00:44:29.375 --> 00:44:30.668
now has gone away.

00:44:30.751 --> 00:44:32.503
Oh.

00:44:33.962 --> 00:44:35.047
Oh, now.

00:44:35.130 --> 00:44:38.676
No use for this sobbing, my lord.

00:44:40.386 --> 00:44:41.470
Do you still see…

00:44:43.972 --> 00:44:45.849
tear marks on my cheeks and face?

00:44:46.809 --> 00:44:47.893
Mm-hmm.

00:44:48.727 --> 00:44:50.145
Missus!

00:44:54.316 --> 00:44:55.651
Missus.

00:44:56.652 --> 00:44:57.736
Hand me the mirror.

00:44:57.820 --> 00:44:59.655
Did you finish all the clothes?

00:45:00.739 --> 00:45:02.741
Oh!

00:45:11.667 --> 00:45:14.336
Do you have any tobacco to share, madam?

00:45:14.920 --> 00:45:16.255
The temper you're showing.

00:46:01.467 --> 00:46:02.593
Dear cousin.

00:46:10.809 --> 00:46:13.645
Huh? Would you look at this lord?

00:46:13.729 --> 00:46:15.481
That tickles!

00:46:23.280 --> 00:46:24.281
You.

00:46:25.491 --> 00:46:26.617
How are you…

00:46:28.660 --> 00:46:29.953
beyond gorgeous?

00:47:28.053 --> 00:47:31.557
Oh, wait. Wait, sir.

00:47:32.391 --> 00:47:34.518
Oh, why are you in such a hurry?